### ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 19 - SELF-EVOLVE (BEHAVIORAL DIRECTIVES) SELF-EVALUATION
###
### Covers the self-evolve module's admin REST surface
### (com.amsha.app.api.AdminDirectiveResource):
###   - List / get behavioral directives
###   - Synthesize (Phase 9 rule extraction -> SHADOW directives)
###   - Reconcile (promote/disable SHADOW directives)
###   - Disable / delete directives
###
### Authorization model:
###   - GET endpoints:             any valid API key
###   - POST/DELETE write endpoints: internal API key only (403 on CI key)
###
### Prerequisites: Amsha Agent running in serve mode
###
### NOTE: SE-5/SE-6/SE-7 require a real directive ID. After
### running SE-2 (synthesize) or SE-3 (list), copy a returned
### directiveId into @directiveId below, then run those blocks.
### ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

@baseUrl    = http://localhost:8080
@validKey   = key-internal-changeme
@ciKey      = key-ci-changeme

### Capture a directive ID after synthesize/list (populate manually)
@directiveId = REPLACE_WITH_REAL_DIRECTIVE_ID

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FLOW A: LIST & READ
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [SE-1] List directives (authorized, default limit=20)
# Expect 200 OK + JSON array of SynthesizedDirective
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/directives
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [SE-2] List directives (explicit limit)
# Expect 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/directives?limit=5
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [SE-3] Get directive by ID (valid key, existing)
# Expect 200 OK when @directiveId is set; 404 if missing
# @name getDirective
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/directives/{{directiveId}}
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [SE-4] Get directive by ID (non-existent -> 404)
# Expect 404 Not Found + AmshaErrorResponse
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/directives/does-not-exist-0000
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FLOW B: WRITE ENDPOINTS — AUTHORIZATION
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [SE-5] Synthesize directives (unauthorized CI key)
# Expect 403 Forbidden
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/directives/synthesize
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{ciKey}}

###

### [SE-6] Synthesize directives (authorized internal key)
# Expect 200 OK + JSON array (may be empty if insufficient memory)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/directives/synthesize
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [SE-7] Reconcile directives (unauthorized CI key)
# Expect 403 Forbidden
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/directives/reconcile
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{ciKey}}

###

### [SE-8] Reconcile directives (authorized internal key)
# Expect 200 OK + {"actionsTaken":N}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/directives/reconcile
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FLOW C: PER-DIRECTIVE WRITE — AUTHORIZATION & NOT-FOUND
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [SE-9] Disable directive (unauthorized CI key)
# Expect 403 Forbidden
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/directives/{{directiveId}}/disable
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{ciKey}}

###

### [SE-10] Disable directive (non-existent -> 404)
# Expect 404 Not Found
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/directives/does-not-exist-0000/disable
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [SE-11] Disable directive (authorized, existing -> DISABLED state)
# Expect 200 OK + directive with state=DISABLED
# Run SE-6 first and set @directiveId (use an ACTIVE/SHADOW id, not already DISABLED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/directives/{{directiveId}}/disable
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [SE-12] Delete directive (unauthorized CI key)
# Expect 403 Forbidden
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/directives/{{directiveId}}
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{ciKey}}

###

### [SE-13] Delete directive (non-existent -> 404)
# Expect 404 Not Found
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/directives/does-not-exist-0000
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [SE-14] Delete directive (authorized, existing -> 204 No Content)
# Expect 204 No Content
# Run SE-6 first and set @directiveId (use a freshly synthesized SHADOW id)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/directives/{{directiveId}}
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###
